"How do I delete my Household? – tonies® Support (https://support.tonies.com/hc/en-us/articles/29036630818578-How-do-I-delete-my-Household)\nciteturn786view0 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: today; Content type: text/html; Source: open({\"ref_id\":\"turn781view3\",\"lineno\":35}); Total lines: 82\nL0: 【0†Skip to main content】\nL1: \nL2: 【1†Contact us】\nL3: \nL4: [Input] English (United States)\nL5: \nL6: Articles in this section\nL7: \nL8:   * 【2†How do I transfer ownership of my Household?】\nL9:   * 【3†How to create a my.tonies account】\nL10:   * 【4†How do I invite other members into my Household?】\nL11:   * 【5†How do I manage Household members permissions?】\nL12:   * 【6†How do I change the name of my Household?】\nL13:   * 【7†How do I remove a Toniebox 1 from my Household?】\nL14:   * 【8†I'm having trouble logging in to my account】\nL15:   * 【9†How do I delete my Household?】\nL16: # How do I delete my Household?\nL17: \nL18: If you need to delete your Household for any reason, it's important to know that this process will also permanently delete all data, including any recordings that are on Creative Tonies in your Household. If you would like to proceed with deleting your Household, follow the steps below.\nL19: \nL20: How to delete your Household:\nL21: \nL22: Using the tonies app\nL23: \nL24: 【10†iframe†www.youtube-nocookie.com】\nL25:   1. Open the tonies app and tap your profile picture in the top-right side of the screen.\nL26: 【11†Image: Profile__1_.jpg】\nL27: \nL28:   2. Tap 'Household'.\nL29: 【12†Image: Permissions_Step_2.jpg】\nL30: \nL31:   3. Tap the settings icon in the upper-right hand side of the screen.\nL32: 【13†Image: Delete_HH_Step_3.jpg】\nL33: \nL34:   4. Tap 'Dissolve Household'.\nL35: 【14†Image: Delete_HH_Step_4.jpg】\nL36: \nL37:   5. Tap the red 'Delete' button to confirm that you wish to permanently delete the Household.\nL38: 【15†Image: DeleteHH__2_.jpg】\nL39:   6. You have now successfully deleted your Household and all data will also be permanently deleted.\nL40: Using my.tonies.com\nL41: \nL42: 【16†iframe†www.youtube-nocookie.com】\nL43:   1. Login to your account at 【17†my.tonies.com†my.tonies.com】 and click the 'Members' tab.\nL44: 【18†Image: TransferStep1.jpg】\nL45: \nL46:   2. Click the 'Household preferences' dropdown.\nL47: 【19†Image: Step2Delete.jpg】\nL48: \nL49:   3. Click on 'Delete this household'.\nL50: 【20†Image: Step3Delete.jpg】\nL51: \nL52:   4. Click on 'Delete Household' in the window that appears to confirm that you wish to permanently delete the Household.\nL53: 【21†Image: Step4Delete.jpg】\nL54:   5. You have now successfully deleted your Household and all data will also be permanently deleted.\nL55: If you are having any trouble deleting your Household, 【1†send us a message】 and we will help guide you through the process!\nL56: \nL57: 【22†Return to top】\nL58: \nL59: Return to top\nL60: ## Was this article helpful?\nL61: \nL62: [Button: Yes] [Button: No]\nL63: \nL64: 26 out of 51 found this helpful\nL65: \nL66: Have more questions? 【1†Submit a request】\nL67: \nL68: ### In this article\nL69: \nL70: Contents Articles\nL71: \nL72: ### Title\nL73: \nL74: [Button: ×]\nL75: \nL76: 【23†tonies® Support】\nL77: \nL78:   * 【24†Imprint†login.tonies.com】\nL79:   * 【25†Privacy policy†login.tonies.com】\nL80:   * 【26†Cookie Settings】\nL81:   * © tonies GmbH\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nHow do I invite other members into my Household? – tonies® Support (https://support.tonies.com/hc/en-us/articles/29036487201170-How-do-I-invite-other-members-into-my-Household)\nciteturn786view1 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: today; Content type: text/html; Source: open({\"ref_id\":\"turn778view3\",\"lineno\":50}); Total lines: 90\nL0: 【0†Skip to main content】\nL1: \nL2: 【1†Contact us】\nL3: \nL4: [Input] English (United States)\nL5: \nL6: Articles in this section\nL7: \nL8:   * 【2†How do I transfer ownership of my Household?】\nL9:   * 【3†How to create a my.tonies account】\nL10:   * 【4†How do I invite other members into my Household?】\nL11:   * 【5†How do I manage Household members permissions?】\nL12:   * 【6†How do I change the name of my Household?】\nL13:   * 【7†How do I remove a Toniebox 1 from my Household?】\nL14:   * 【8†I'm having trouble logging in to my account】\nL15:   * 【9†How do I delete my Household?】\nL16: # How do I invite other members into my Household?\nL17: \nL18: Want to allow others into your Household to record messages onto your Creative Tonies? This is one of the best features about Creative Tonies! All that is required for the other members to have is a free 【10†my.tonies.com†my.tonies.com】 account. Follow these steps and you will be good to go in no time!\nL19: \nL20: How to invite other members into your Household:\nL21: \nL22: Using the tonies app\nL23: \nL24: 【11†iframe†www.youtube-nocookie.com】\nL25:   1. Open the tonies app and tap your profile picture in the top-right side of the screen.\nL26: 【12†Image: Profile.jpg】\nL27: \nL28:   2. Tap 'Household'.\nL29: 【13†Image: Permissions_Step_2.jpg】\nL30: \nL31:   3. Tap the red '+' plus sign on the top-right hand side of the screen.\nL32: 【14†Image: Invite_Step_2.jpg】\nL33:   4. Here you can select the permission level you want the new member to have. You can make them either a Full member (allowed to manage Tonieboxes, Creative Tonies and other members) or only a Creative Tonie member (may only edit Creative Tonies that you choose). Tap on the type of member you would like to choose.\nL34: 【15†Image: Invite_Step_3.jpg】\nL35: \nL36:   5. A prompt will appear to enter the individual's email address. Type in the email address and then tap 'Next'.\nL37: 【16†Image: Invite_Step_4.jpg】\nL38:   6. Tap 'Confirm'.\nL39: 【17†Image: Invite_Step_5.jpg】\nL40: \nL41:   7. Success! The member will now receive an email to accept the invitation.\nL42: 【18†Image: Invite_Step_6.jpg】\nL43: \nL44:   8. Below is an example of the email invitation the invited member will receive. All they need to do is click 'Accept Invitation' and they will be prompted to login to their account and confirm that they want to join your Household.\nL45: 【19†Image: HouseholdInvite2.jpg】\nL46:   9. Note that if you have chosen to make the member a Creative Tonie member, you will just need to follow through an additional process once the member accepts the invitation to select which specific Creative Tonies you would like them to have access to. For a full walkthrough of this process, check out our other support article here: 【5†How do I manage Household members permissions?】\nL47:   10. Once the member is officially added to your Household, they will either see all of your Tonies or only the Creative Tonies you have given them access to in their tonies app or in their my.tonies.com account. They are then all set to record/upload content to a Creative Tonie the same way you currently do. Just in case, for steps walking through that process, take a look at our other support article here: 【20†How do I add content onto my Creative Tonie?】\nL48: Using my.tonies.com\nL49: \nL50: 【21†iframe†www.youtube-nocookie.com】\nL51:   1. Login to my.tonies.com and click the 'Members' heading.\nL52: 【22†Image: householdFAQ1.jpg】\nL53: \nL54:   2. Under your Household settings, click the button that says 'Add member.'\nL55: 【23†Image: householdFAQ2.jpg】\nL56:   3. A prompt will appear to enter the email of the individual you want to add and then select the permission level you want them to have. You can make them either a full member (allowed to manage Tonieboxes, Creative Tonies and members) or only a Creative Tonie member (may only edit Creative Tonies). Click to send the invite and they will receive an email to accept the invitation.\nL57: 【24†Image: householdFAQ3.jpg】\nL58:   4. Below is an example of the email invitation the invited member will receive. All they need to do is click 'Accept Invitation' and they will be prompted to login to their account and confirm they want to join your Household.\nL59: 【25†Image: householdFAQ4.jpg】\nL60:   5. Once the member is added to your Household, they will either see all of your Tonies or only the Creative Tonies you have given them access to in their tonies app or in their my.tonies.com account. They are then all set to record/upload content to a Creative Tonie the same way you currently do. Just in case, for steps walking through that process, take a look at our other support article here: 【20†How do I add content onto my Creative Tonie?】\nL61: \nL62: \nL63: If you run into any problems inviting others into your Household, 【1†send us a message】 with your Toniebox 1 ID and Tonies account email and help will be on the way!\nL64: \nL65: 【26†Return to top】\nL66: \nL67: Return to top\nL68: ## Was this article helpful?\nL69: \nL70: [Button: Yes] [Button: No]\nL71: \nL72: 30 out of 70 found this helpful\nL73: \nL74: Have more questions? 【1†Submit a request】\nL75: \nL76: ### In this article\nL77: \nL78: Contents Articles\nL79: \nL80: ### Title\nL81: \nL82: [Button: ×]\nL83: \nL84: 【27†tonies® Support】\nL85: \nL86:   * 【28†Imprint†login.tonies.com】\nL87:   * 【29†Privacy policy†login.tonies.com】\nL88:   * 【30†Cookie Settings】\nL89:   * © tonies GmbH\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nHow do I transfer ownership of my Household? – tonies® Support (https://support.tonies.com/hc/en-150/articles/29206380198162-How-do-I-transfer-ownership-of-my-Household)\nciteturn786view2 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: last week; Content type: text/html; Source: open({\"ref_id\":\"turn783search0\",\"lineno\":25}); Total lines: 68\nL0: 【0†Skip to main content】\nL1: \nL2: 【1†Contact us】\nL3: \nL4: [Input] English (Europe)\nL5: \nL6: Articles in this section\nL7: \nL8:   * 【2†How do I transfer ownership of my Household?】\nL9:   * 【3†How to create a my.tonies account】\nL10:   * 【4†How do I invite other members into my Household?】\nL11:   * 【5†How do I manage Household members permissions?】\nL12:   * 【6†How do I change the name of my Household?】\nL13:   * 【7†How do I remove a Toniebox from my Household?】\nL14:   * 【8†I'm having trouble logging in to my account】\nL15:   * 【9†How do I delete my Household?】\nL16: # How do I transfer ownership of my Household?\nL17: \nL18: If you have already set up a Toniebox in your Household but would like to give the Toniebox as a gift, you will need to transfer ownership of the Household to the gift recipient.\nL19: \nL20: To transfer ownership of your Household, you will first need to invite the other member into your Household. For a walkthrough on this process, check out our support article here: 【10†How do I invite other members into my Household?】\nL21: It is also important to note that, in order to transfer ownership of a Household to another member, that member must not already be the owner of their own Household. If they have already set up their own Household and do not own a Toniebox, they will need to delete their Household. For detailed steps on this process, check out our support article here: 【9†How do I delete my Household?】\nL22: Once these steps have been completed, you are ready to transfer ownership of your Household! To do this, follow these steps:\nL23: \nL24: 【11†iframe†www.youtube-nocookie.com】\nL25:   1. Login to your account at 【12†my.tonies.com†my.tonies.com】 and click the 'Members' tab.\nL26: 【13†Image: TransferStep1.jpg】\nL27: \nL28:   2. Click the 'Household preferences' dropdown.\nL29: 【14†Image: TransferStep2.jpg】\nL30: \nL31:   3. Click 'Leave this household'.\nL32: 【15†Image: TransferStep3.jpg】\nL33:   4. Once you click 'Leave this household', a window will appear where you can choose to either specify another member as the new owner of the Household or dissolve (delete) the Household entirely. Choose the intended new owner of the Household by clicking the white circle next to their name and email address. It's important to note that you will not see a recipient listed here if they already own their own Household.\nL34: 【16†Image: TransferStep4.jpg】\nL35:   5. Once you have specified the intended new owner, click 'Set New Owner'.\nL36: 【17†Image: TransferStep5.jpg】\nL37: \nL38:   6. This will transfer ownership of the Household to the new member and you will automatically leave the Household. If you would like to rejoin the Household, the new owner will simply need to invite you back into the Household with the same process you used before to invite them.\nL39: If you are having any trouble transferring ownership of your Household, 【18†send us a message】 and we will help guide you through the process!\nL40: \nL41: \nL42: \nL43: 【19†Return to top】\nL44: \nL45: Return to top\nL46: ## Was this article helpful?\nL47: \nL48: [Button: Yes] [Button: No]\nL49: \nL50: 4 out of 4 found this helpful\nL51: \nL52: Have more questions? 【1†Submit a request】\nL53: \nL54: ### In this article\nL55: \nL56: Contents Articles\nL57: \nL58: ### Title\nL59: \nL60: [Button: ×]\nL61: \nL62: 【20†tonies® Support】\nL63: \nL64:   * 【21†Imprint†login.tonies.com】\nL65:   * 【22†Privacy policy†login.tonies.com】\nL66:   * 【23†Cookie Settings】\nL67:   * © tonies GmbH\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nHow long does the Toniebox 2 remember your auto-saved status when you remove the disc, take a break or play something else? – tonies® Support (https://support.tonies.com/hc/en-us/articles/29036389045778-How-long-does-the-Toniebox-2-remember-your-auto-saved-status-when-you-remove-the-disc-take-a-break-or-play-something-else)\nciteturn786view3 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: 5 days ago; Content type: text/html; Source: open({\"ref_id\":\"turn778search1\",\"lineno\":20}); Total lines: 47\nL0: 【0†Skip to main content】\nL1: \nL2: 【1†Contact us】\nL3: \nL4: [Input] English (United States)\nL5: \nL6: Articles in this section\nL7:   * 【2†What is Tonieplay?】\nL8:   * 【3†Tonieplay - Troubleshooting Tips】\nL9:   * 【4†Tonieplay game card not recognised】\nL10:   * 【5†How long does the Toniebox 2 remember your auto-saved status when you remove the disc, take a break or play something else?】\nL11:   * 【6†Can you ever choose the chapter?】\nL12:   * 【7†Can I restart a Tonieplay game?】\nL13:   * 【8†What do I need in order to play a Tonieplay game?】\nL14:   * 【9†What aged children is Tonieplay suitable for?】\nL15:   * 【10†Is Tonieplay compatible with Toniebox 1?】\nL16:   * 【11†Are Tonieplay games multiplayer?】\nL17: 【12†See more】\nL18: # How long does the Toniebox 2 remember your auto-saved status when you remove the disc, take a break or play something else?\nL19: If you remove your Tonieplay disc for a break or to play another Tonie product, the progress will stop. This means that the game is not \"paused\" anymore, but you will load it up from scratch again.\nL20: However, each game acts a little differently. For example the quiz games will not continue a running round of let's say 5 questions. An interactive story will be resumable at the last position. A Discover Game will start a new \"round\".\nL21: \nL22: 【13†Return to top】\nL23: \nL24: Return to top\nL25: ## Was this article helpful?\nL26: \nL27: [Button: Yes] [Button: No]\nL28: \nL29: 6 out of 16 found this helpful\nL30: \nL31: Have more questions? 【1†Submit a request】\nL32: \nL33: ### In this article\nL34: \nL35: Contents Articles\nL36: \nL37: ### Title\nL38: \nL39: [Button: ×]\nL40: \nL41: 【14†tonies® Support】\nL42: \nL43:   * 【15†Imprint†login.tonies.com】\nL44:   * 【16†Privacy policy†login.tonies.com】\nL45:   * 【17†Cookie Settings】\nL46:   * © tonies GmbH\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nCan I restart a Tonieplay game? – tonies® Support (https://support.tonies.com/hc/en-150/articles/29036401221522-Can-I-restart-a-Tonieplay-game)\nciteturn786view4 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: last week; Content type: text/html; Source: open({\"ref_id\":\"turn775search1\",\"lineno\":20}); Total lines: 55\nL0: 【0†Skip to main content】\nL1: \nL2: 【1†Contact us】\nL3: \nL4: [Input] English (Europe)\nL5: \nL6: Articles in this section\nL7:   * 【2†What is Tonieplay?】\nL8:   * 【3†Tonieplay - Troubleshooting Tips】\nL9:   * 【4†Tonieplay game card not recognised】\nL10:   * 【5†How long does the Toniebox 2 remember your auto-saved status when you remove the disc, take a break or play something else?】\nL11:   * 【6†Can you ever choose the chapter?】\nL12:   * 【7†Can I restart a Tonieplay game?】\nL13:   * 【8†What do I need in order to play a Tonieplay game?】\nL14:   * 【9†What aged children is Tonieplay suitable for?】\nL15:   * 【10†Is Tonieplay compatible with Toniebox 1?】\nL16:   * 【11†Are Tonieplay games multiplayer?】\nL17: 【12†See more】\nL18: # Can I restart a Tonieplay game?\nL19: \nL20: Need to go back a bit in your game?\nL21: \nL22: Easy! Simply lift the Tonieplay Disc off your Toniebox 2, count to five (a little dramatic pause never hurt anyone ✨), and pop it back on. Your game will restart from the top, or depending on the Tonieplay game, will pick up at your most recent checkpoint, if you've reached one. Think of it as closing a book and opening it again to your bookmarked page...\nL23: \nL24: A few things to know:\nL25:   * A full reset is not possible, until the game is completed so keep on playing.\nL26:   * No checkpoint yet? The game will begin from the very start of your adventure.\nL27:   * Reached a checkpoint? Taking the disc off and back on will restart the game to that checkpoint.\nL28:   * Mid-adventure and want a quick breather? Removing the disc is a safe way to pause and step away; just pop it back on when you're ready to continue.\nL29: \nL30: 【13†Return to top】\nL31: \nL32: Return to top\nL33: ## Was this article helpful?\nL34: \nL35: [Button: Yes] [Button: No]\nL36: \nL37: 10 out of 58 found this helpful\nL38: \nL39: Have more questions? 【1†Submit a request】\nL40: \nL41: ### In this article\nL42: \nL43: Contents Articles\nL44: \nL45: ### Title\nL46: \nL47: [Button: ×]\nL48: \nL49: 【14†tonies® Support】\nL50: \nL51:   * 【15†Imprint†login.tonies.com】\nL52:   * 【16†Privacy policy†login.tonies.com】\nL53:   * 【17†Cookie Settings】\nL54:   * © tonies GmbH\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nWhat do I need in order to play a Tonieplay game? – tonies® Support (https://support.tonies.com/hc/en-gb/articles/29036518566802-What-do-I-need-in-order-to-play-a-Tonieplay-game)\nciteturn786view5 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: last month; Content type: text/html; Source: click({\"ref_id\":\"turn775view0\",\"id\":8}); Total lines: 49\nL0: 【0†Skip to main content】\nL1: \nL2: 【1†Contact us】\nL3: \nL4: [Input] English (United Kingdom)\nL5: \nL6: Articles in this section\nL7:   * 【2†What is Tonieplay?】\nL8:   * 【3†Tonieplay - Troubleshooting Tips】\nL9:   * 【4†Tonieplay game card not recognised】\nL10:   * 【5†How long does the Toniebox 2 remember your auto-saved status when you remove the disc, take a break or play something else?】\nL11:   * 【6†Can you ever choose the chapter?】\nL12:   * 【7†Can I restart a Tonieplay game?】\nL13:   * 【8†What do I need in order to play a Tonieplay game?】\nL14:   * 【9†What aged children is Tonieplay suitable for?】\nL15:   * 【10†Is Tonieplay compatible with Toniebox 1?】\nL16:   * 【11†Are Tonieplay games multiplayer?】\nL17: 【12†See more】\nL18: # What do I need in order to play a Tonieplay game?\nL19: \nL20: To play a Tonieplay Game you’ll need a Toniebox 2 and a Tonieplay Controller.\nL21: \nL22: If it’s the first time the game is being played you’ll also need a WiFi connection, but after this it will work offline too.\nL23: \nL24: 【13†Return to top】\nL25: \nL26: Return to top\nL27: \nL28: ## Was this article helpful?\nL29: \nL30: [Button: Yes] [Button: No]\nL31: \nL32: 17 out of 40 found this helpful\nL33: \nL34: Have more questions? 【1†Submit a request】\nL35: \nL36: ### In this article\nL37: \nL38: Contents Articles\nL39: ### Title\nL40: \nL41: [Button: ×]\nL42: \nL43: 【14†tonies® Support】\nL44: \nL45:   * 【15†Imprint†login.tonies.com】\nL46:   * 【16†Privacy policy†login.tonies.com】\nL47:   * 【17†Cookie Settings】\nL48:   * © tonies GmbH\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nWhat new Tonieplay specific data will we capture? – tonies® Support (https://support.tonies.com/hc/en-gb/articles/29264253409682-What-new-Tonieplay-specific-data-will-we-capture)\nciteturn786view6 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: last month; Content type: text/html; Source: click({\"ref_id\":\"turn775view0\",\"id\":15}); Total lines: 46\nL0: 【0†Skip to main content】\nL1: \nL2: 【1†Contact us】\nL3: \nL4: [Input] English (United Kingdom)\nL5: \nL6: Articles in this section\nL7:   * 【2†What is Tonieplay?】\nL8:   * 【3†Tonieplay - Troubleshooting Tips】\nL9:   * 【4†Tonieplay game card not recognised】\nL10:   * 【5†How long does the Toniebox 2 remember your auto-saved status when you remove the disc, take a break or play something else?】\nL11:   * 【6†Can you ever choose the chapter?】\nL12:   * 【7†Can I restart a Tonieplay game?】\nL13:   * 【8†What do I need in order to play a Tonieplay game?】\nL14:   * 【9†What aged children is Tonieplay suitable for?】\nL15:   * 【10†Is Tonieplay compatible with Toniebox 1?】\nL16:   * 【11†Are Tonieplay games multiplayer?】\nL17: 【12†See more】\nL18: # What new Tonieplay specific data will we capture?\nL19: When you use the new function Tonieplay, usage and operation information about the in-game interaction with the Toniebox will be collected. We process the data (e.g. frequency of use of individual games, errors that resulted in termination of use) for the same purpose as we process all other Interaction Data of the Toniebox.\nL20: Please find more information about processing Interaction Data in our Privacy Notice in Section “Data Usage, Toniebox, Tonies, mytonies and the Tonies Account” paragraph 3 and the following.\nL21: 【13†Return to top】\nL22: \nL23: Return to top\nL24: ## Was this article helpful?\nL25: \nL26: [Button: Yes] [Button: No]\nL27: \nL28: 2 out of 5 found this helpful\nL29: \nL30: Have more questions? 【1†Submit a request】\nL31: \nL32: ### In this article\nL33: \nL34: Contents Articles\nL35: \nL36: ### Title\nL37: \nL38: [Button: ×]\nL39: \nL40: 【14†tonies® Support】\nL41: \nL42:   * 【15†Imprint†login.tonies.com】\nL43:   * 【16†Privacy policy†login.tonies.com】\nL44:   * 【17†Cookie Settings】\nL45:   * © tonies GmbH\n"
